    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834630/extras/96e88aca90c6cb6029a1b20b3fc83e33.poster.webp?t=1755568618\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834630/extras/96e88aca90c6cb6029a1b20b3fc83e33.webp?t=1755568618\" class=\"bb_img\" width=618 height=214 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No screaming \ud83e\udd2b</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>D\u00ea 1 Bit ao GustavoGek</strong> is a questionable mix of <strong>horror</strong> and <strong>comedy</strong>. Just after you insult your favorite streamer, you\u2019re dragged into a cursed game controlled by the unpredictable <strong>GlitchedGus</strong> \u2014 and now, you must <strong>collect</strong> and <strong>deliver</strong> <strong>bits</strong> to him, as he pleases. Get ready to face levels filled with challenges and bizarre enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the famous <strong>nextbots</strong> \u2014 mechanic of PNGs that chase you non-stop \u2014 the game takes this concept to the extreme with plot twists, hidden secrets, not-that-hard puzzles, and a sus sense of humor, all wrapped in a chaotic environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can laugh, you can shit yourself, you can laugh until you shit yourself... but don\u2019t forget to give 1 bit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>WARNING: THIS GAME CONTAINS FLASHING LIGHTS AND IMAGES</i></strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834630/extras/96e88aca90c6cb6029a1b20b3fc83e33.poster.webp?t=1755568618\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834630/extras/96e88aca90c6cb6029a1b20b3fc83e33.webp?t=1755568618\" class=\"bb_img\" width=618 height=214 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No screaming \ud83e\udd2b</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>D\u00ea 1 Bit ao GustavoGek</strong> is a questionable mix of <strong>horror</strong> and <strong>comedy</strong>. Just after you insult your favorite streamer, you\u2019re dragged into a cursed game controlled by the unpredictable <strong>GlitchedGus</strong> \u2014 and now, you must <strong>collect</strong> and <strong>deliver</strong> <strong>bits</strong> to him, as he pleases. Get ready to face levels filled with challenges and bizarre enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the famous <strong>nextbots</strong> \u2014 mechanic of PNGs that chase you non-stop \u2014 the game takes this concept to the extreme with plot twists, hidden secrets, not-that-hard puzzles, and a sus sense of humor, all wrapped in a chaotic environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can laugh, you can shit yourself, you can laugh until you shit yourself... but don\u2019t forget to give 1 bit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>WARNING: THIS GAME CONTAINS FLASHING LIGHTS AND IMAGES</i></strong></p>",
